4. Explanation
The Express server listens on port 3000 (or the port defined in the environment).
The /chat route expects a JSON object with a "prompt" property.
When a valid request is received, the backend constructs a payload for the LLM API (using OpenAI's Chat Completions endpoint as an example).
Axios is used to perform the HTTP POST request to the LLM endpoint along with the required API key.
The LLM's response is extracted and returned to the client.
This example demonstrates a straightforward end-to-end call from receiving a user prompt to delivering the LLM-generated response.
